    en: 'A community where humanity, spirit and nature form a greater whole. Where we as nature people live in balance with nature\'s cycles, the landscape we inhabit and all living things. In a mutual dependence that we take responsibility for – where the duality between spiritual power and life force is expressed in our way of life, rituals and ceremonies. A deeper community where nature\'s pulse beats in rhythm with your own soul.', sa: "Servošat gos olmmoš, vuoiŋŋa ja luondu leat stuorát ollisvuođa oassi. Gos mii luondduálbmogin eallit dássedeattus luonddu jorggáldagaiguin, luonddueanadagas mas mii eallit ja buot ealliin. Gaskavuođalaš sorjavašvuođas man ovddas mii váldit ovddasvástádusa – gos vuoiŋŋafámu ja eallinfámu guovttádatvuohta boahtá ovdan min eallinvuogis, rituálain ja seremoniijain. Čiekŋalut servošat gos luonddu pulsa čuohcá seamma távttas go du iežat siellu."
